window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>You can’t silence this heartbeat.</b></p> <p>Meg didn’t want the heartbeat in her womb or the constant threat to her friends. She decides it’s best to disappear. Meg runs to the Earthen plane to hide and plan her next step. While lighting strikes and dark hungers keep her running, a mysterious man seems a little too helpful. Will Meg destroy the one man who will follow her through hell and high water?</p>"; 
